{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Operator-added post-merge acceptance addendum (2026-08-14): after the routing workflow is merged, verify both live branches of the production classifier. (1) A genuine documentation-only change selects the focused docs-only job, retains all documentation gates, and skips the full OS/Python, mutation, packaging, optionality, artifact, eval, golden-path, and identity graph. (2) A genuine non-documentation change selects the full route and completes the full test suite and required mutation/packaging/supporting jobs. Record Gerrit change, patchset, GitHub run, route/job evidence, conclusions, wall clock, and runner-minutes. Prefer an existing post-merge non-doc change rather than generating artificial runner usage."},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786733905050877001,"uuid":"3e10abf6-23d0-4ce1-b674-3a37362f8c8b"}